note """serialization fixture: ONE Go type declared FOUR ways in one flow — a state entry, a var, a declared output and the implicit input. Sealed is the spelling because it produces exactly one structural refusal at either site, so the HINT count alone separates the two erased kinds from the two concrete ones. A kind mapped to the wrong loader.Site moves those numbers while every message stays recognisable."""
flow Screening (Sealed) -> ok Sealed
state {
  cell Sealed
}
var alpha Sealed
transform ok Compute from in
sink store Save from ok
